window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Only in death does she find her true power and her soulmate.<br> <br> Violent visions have haunted Meghan her entire life, but little does she know they have a reason and a purpose. When she arrives in the Afterworld, she learns her true identity: Megaera, one of the furies and goddess of envious wrath, cursed by Kronos, the Titan king himself. And if that wasn't bad enough, the gorgeous shapeshifter, Aaron, wants to deliver her to Hades, while the Olympian gods will stop at nothing to kill her for good. Can she break the curse without it breaking her first?<br> <br> A New Adult Greek Mythology Fantasy Romance with enemies to lovers, fated mates, forced proximity, a badass heroine who would burn the world for the people she loves and a broody love interest with a dark backstory.</p>"; 
